{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're in prison. You need to escape. But do you have what it takes?</strong><br>Guts? Maybe.<br>Willpower? 100%.<br>A get-out-of-jail-free card? In your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Front gate keys? You\u2019ll have to steal them from the guards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight guards and take their keys! Not strong enough? Hit the gym. Everyone starts as fresh meat, but some climb their way up to become the top dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tools?</strong> <strong>Check out other inmates\u2019 stashes.</strong><br>Everyone hides something around here.<br>Even if you can't find what you want, you can gather materials and craft it. Don\u2019t know how? Visit the library. You may not be an engineer, but you\u2019re smart enough to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can\u2019t steal? Then buy.</strong><br>Some prisoners use their status to access forbidden areas. Others smuggle contrabands from the outside. If you\u2019ve got the cash, you can get anything\u2014from a paperclip to a burner phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No money?</strong><br>If you're ready to get your hands dirty, there are always shady jobs from fellow inmates.<br>Want to stay clean? Work for the prison industry. The pay\u2019s low, but it grants access to restricted zones and restricted items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can\u2019t take on the guards or gangs alone?</strong><br>Then build your crew:<br>The muscle, the resource guy, the funny one, and the mastermind behind the escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just find the way out.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851150?t=1765916934","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851150?t=1765916934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851150/dde835e071e470e82b28a1d58f9192cf0bffb9bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765916934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851150/dde835e071e470e82b28a1d58f9192cf0bffb9bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765916934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're in prison. You need to escape. But do you have what it takes?</strong><br>Guts? Maybe.<br>Willpower? 100%.<br>A get-out-of-jail-free card? In your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Front gate keys? You\u2019ll have to steal them from the guards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight guards and take their keys! Not strong enough? Hit the gym. Everyone starts as fresh meat, but some climb their way up to become the top dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tools?</strong> <strong>Check out other inmates\u2019 stashes.</strong><br>Everyone hides something around here.<br>Even if you can't find what you want, you can gather materials and craft it. Don\u2019t know how? Visit the library. You may not be an engineer, but you\u2019re smart enough to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can\u2019t steal? Then buy.</strong><br>Some prisoners use their status to access forbidden areas. Others smuggle contrabands from the outside. If you\u2019ve got the cash, you can get anything\u2014from a paperclip to a burner phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No money?</strong><br>If you're ready to get your hands dirty, there are always shady jobs from fellow inmates.<br>Want to stay clean? Work for the prison industry. The pay\u2019s low, but it grants access to restricted zones and restricted items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can\u2019t take on the guards or gangs alone?</strong><br>Then build your crew:<br>The muscle, the resource guy, the funny one, and the mastermind behind the escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just find the way out.</strong></p>","developers":["Furce Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851150/de75ebae704eb588b1a3c83fd2774c146e3440db/header.jpg?t=1765916934","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"To The Freedom","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960  / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F / AMD ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 GB available space</li></ul>"},"pla